<span class="text-primary">1.</span> Introduction
                                </h2>
<p class="mb-4">
                                    Welcome to Ephemera. These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of our website, disposable email services, and developer APIs (collectively, the "Services"). By accessing or using the Services, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, you may not access or use the Services.
                                </p>
<p>
                                    Ephemera is designed for privacy-conscious developers and users who require temporary email solutions. We prioritize data minimalism and security above all else.
                                </p>
</section>
<!-- Account Security -->
<section class="scroll-mt-32" id="security">
<h2 class="text-white text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="text-primary">2.</span> Account Security
                                </h2>
<p class="mb-4">
                                    You are responsible for safeguarding the password and API keys that you use to access the Services and for any activities or actions under your password or API keys. We encourage you to use "strong" passwords (passwords that use a combination of upper and lower case letters, numbers and symbols) with your account.
