<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-orange-400 shrink-0">warning</span>
<div>
<h4 class="text-orange-200 font-bold text-sm mb-1">API Key Security</h4>
<p class="text-orange-200/80 text-sm">Do not commit your API keys to public repositories (e.g., GitHub). Ephemera will automatically revoke keys found in public leaks to protect your account quota.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
