<span class="text-primary">3.</span> API Usage Limits
                                </h2>
<p class="mb-4">
                                    Ephemera provides various subscription tiers with specific rate limits to ensure quality of service for all users.
                                </p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4 marker:text-primary">
<li><strong>Free Tier:</strong> Limited to 100 requests per hour. No custom domains.</li>
<li><strong>Developer Tier:</strong> 10,000 requests per hour. Custom webhook support.</li>
<li><strong>Enterprise Tier:</strong> Unlimited requests (subject to fair use) and dedicated support.</li>
</ul>
<p>
                                    Exceeding these limits may result in temporary throttling of your API access (HTTP 429). Persistent abuse may lead to account suspension.
                                </p>
</section>
