<span class="text-primary">4.</span> Anonymity Guarantees
                                </h2>
<p class="mb-6">
                                    We are committed to the principle of data minimalism. Our architecture is designed to know as little about you as possible while still providing the service.
                                </p>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div class="bg-[#101023] p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-white">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-green-400">check_circle</span>
<span class="font-bold">What We Store</span>
</div>
<ul class="text-sm space-y-2 text-[#9090cb]">
