</div>
<div class="bg-[#101023] p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-white">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-red-400">cancel</span>
<span class="font-bold">What We Do NOT Store</span>
</div>
<ul class="text-sm space-y-2 text-[#9090cb]">
<li>Your IP Address logs</li>
<li>Browser User-Agent strings</li>
<li>Payment Details (handled by Stripe)</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>
